ots should check","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"three patterns:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Enum and CasePath usage already match."}]},{"type":"text","text":" No action is needed. Generated"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"members tighten to match the enum, and same-module consumer code keeps"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"compiling."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A sibling module reads generated members from a non-public enum."}]},{"text":" Mark","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the enum ","type":"text"},{"code":"public","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"; the old expansion was widening the surface implicitly.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Enum cases are gated on "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@available(...)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" Generated ","type":"text"},{"code":"CasePath","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" members","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"now carry the same availability. Narrow the enclosing function or branch on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"if #available(...)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" at any downstream call site that used a wider window.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"text":"Why `private` maps to `fileprivate`","level":2,"anchor":"Why-private-maps-to-fileprivate","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Generated declarations can originate from distinct macro expansion roles."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Using "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"fileprivate"},{"type":"text","text":" preserves same-file access between those declarations while"},{"type":"tex